                                        QUERY PLAN                                        
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Hash Left Join
   Hash Cond: (e.c1 = d.c1)
   Filter: (NOT (SubPlan 3))
   ->  Seq Scan on sub1 e
   ->  Hash
         ->  Seq Scan on sub1 d
   SubPlan 3
     ->  Nested Loop Left Join
           Join Filter: ((a.c3 = b.c3) AND (alternatives: SubPlan 1 or hashed SubPlan 2))
           ->  Seq Scan on sub1 b
           ->  Materialize
                 ->  Seq Scan on sub1 a
           SubPlan 1
             ->  Result
                   One-Time Filter: (b.c1 = 1)
                   ->  Seq Scan on sub1 c
                         Filter: (c1 = d.c1)
           SubPlan 2
             ->  Seq Scan on sub1 c_1
                   Filter: (c1 = d.c1)
(20 rows)

