                      QUERY PLAN                       
-------------------------------------------------------
 Result
   One-Time Filter: $6
   CTE cte1
     ->  Result
           One-Time Filter: $2
           InitPlan 2 (returns $2)
             ->  Hash Left Join
                   Hash Cond: (a.c3 = b.c3)
                   Join Filter: (SubPlan 1)
                   ->  Seq Scan on sub1 a
                   ->  Hash
                         ->  Seq Scan on sub1 b
                   SubPlan 1
                     ->  Result
                           One-Time Filter: (b.c1 = 1)
                           ->  Seq Scan on sub1 c
                                 Filter: (c1 = b.c1)
           ->  Hash Left Join
                 Hash Cond: (d_1.c1 = e_1.c1)
                 ->  Seq Scan on sub1 d_1
                 ->  Hash
                       ->  Seq Scan on sub1 e_1
   InitPlan 5 (returns $6)
     ->  Hash Left Join
           Hash Cond: (a_1.c3 = b_1.c3)
           Join Filter: (SubPlan 4)
           ->  CTE Scan on cte1 a_1
           ->  Hash
                 ->  CTE Scan on cte1 b_1
           SubPlan 4
             ->  Result
                   One-Time Filter: (b_1.c1 = 1)
                   ->  CTE Scan on cte1 c_1
                         Filter: (c1 = b_1.c1)
   ->  Merge Left Join
         Merge Cond: (d.c1 = e.c1)
         ->  Sort
               Sort Key: d.c1
               ->  CTE Scan on cte1 d
         ->  Sort
               Sort Key: e.c1
               ->  CTE Scan on cte1 e
(42 rows)

